#: src/ch20-03-advanced-types.md:77
msgid ""
"Because `Kilometers` and `i32` are the same type, we can add values of both "
"types and can pass `Kilometers` values to functions that take `i32` "
"parameters. However, using this method, we don’t get the type-checking "
"benefits that we get from the newtype pattern discussed earlier. In other "
"words, if we mix up `Kilometers` and `i32` values somewhere, the compiler "
"will not give us an error."
msgstr ""
"因为`Kilometers`和`i32`是同一类型的，我们可以同时使用这两种类型的值，并且可以"
"将`Kilometers`的值传递给那些需要`i32`参数的函数。然而，使用这种方法，我们无法"
"享受到之前讨论过的新类型模式所带来的类型检查优势。换句话说，如果我们在某些地"
"方混淆了`Kilometers`和`i32`的值，编译器不会给我们报错。"

#: src/ch20-03-advanced-types.md:84
msgid ""
